Ok, here's the trick. Firstly, if they're 'bad' potions (for bad, read
hallucination, confusion, or blindness (and booze? can't remember)) then
you can just dip your unicorn horn in them, and turn them to uncursed water.
You *do* have a unicorn horn, don't you? It might explain why you don't get
past the castle...!

Alternatively, sit all those potions in a pile, and zap a wand of cancellation
at them. Hey presto!

